    "text": "What the US can do is just keep supporting Israel as Trump has done, (and as opposed to what biden did by slow walking munitions, telling not to go to rafah,etc). I do think there is an appetite for peace from actually both sides meaning Israelis and \"palestinians\"- but certainly not hamas. You see that in rallies against hamaz, and certainly Israel is war weary. Personally I don't believe Netanyahu needs a war- a war was thrust upon him- I think though it's a fair point - how did this war start ? why was Israel so blind? Supporting Israel in defeating hamas is an America 1st policy in my book.",
